($s$keynote_cards$s$, $s$17. Anaesthesia and Perioperative Care$s$, false, 912, $s$ASA physical status$s$, null, null, $s$I healthy; II mild systemic disease (controlled hypertension, mild asthma); III severe systemic disease (poorly controlled diabetes, COPD, morbid obesity, stable angina); IV severe disease that is a constant threat to life (recent MI, sepsis, end-stage organ failure); V moribund, not expected to survive without surgery; VI brain-dead organ donor. "E" added for emergency.$s$, null, $s$17. Anaesthesia and Perioperative Care › 17.1 Pre-operative assessment$s$),
