| CRRT | Continuous renal replacement therapy |
| CVC / CVP | Central venous catheter / pressure |
| DKA / HHS | Diabetic ketoacidosis / hyperosmolar hyperglycaemic state |
| DNAR | Do not attempt resuscitation |
| DVT / PE / VTE | Deep vein thrombosis / pulmonary embolism / venous thromboembolism |
| ECG / EEG | Electrocardiogram / electroencephalogram |
| ETT / EtCO₂ | Endotracheal tube / end-tidal carbon dioxide |
| FiO₂ | Fraction of inspired oxygen |
| GCS | Glasgow Coma Scale |
| IABP | Intra-aortic balloon pump |
| ICP / CPP | Intracranial / cerebral perfusion pressure |
| MAP | Mean arterial pressure |
