| NG / OG / PEG | Nasogastric / orogastric / percutaneous endoscopic gastrostomy |
| NPO / NBM | Nothing by mouth |
| PEA | Pulseless electrical activity |
| PEEP / PIP | Positive end-expiratory pressure / peak inspiratory pressure |
| PRN / STAT | As needed / immediately |
| RASS / CAM-ICU / CPOT | Sedation scale / delirium tool / pain tool for non-verbal patients |
| ROSC | Return of spontaneous circulation |
| SBT / SAT | Spontaneous breathing / awakening trial |
| SIADH / DI | Syndrome of inappropriate ADH / diabetes insipidus |
| SIMV / AC / PSV | Ventilator modes (see chapter 10) |
| TBSA | Total body surface area (burns) |
